# The image build only needs docker/ (setup scripts + requirements) and
# package.xml (for rosdep). The repository itself is bind-mounted at runtime by
# docker-compose.yaml, so keeping the build context small makes builds fast and
# stops multi-GB directories from being sent to the daemon.
